# Volkswagen Golf Mk6 five-door hatchback, 2008-2012.
#
# 4,199 mm long, 1,786 mm wide, 1,479 mm high, 2,578 mm wheelbase; 1.2-2.0
# petrol and 1.6/2.0 diesel.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volkswagen_Golf_Mk6
#
# Colours: Tornado Red, Reflex Silver, Black and Candy White are period Golf
# colours.
#
# Weight: 300 in total (red 85, silver 85, black 70, white 60).
#
# Speed 210 km/h; comfort 120/360 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 2008-2012 with a road tail to about 2023.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vw-golf-mk6.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vw-golf-mk6/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

